don't believe it's you.

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ] It's true.
-What is it like when you --

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, what are
some of the things

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:45.265 line:92%
that people say when you call?

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:51.404
-Well, a lot of people reall
start with serious cuss words.

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:52.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:54.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sure. No, you know,
in the middle of dinner,

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
