-And so I've had people ask me

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:18.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, "Okay, this is gonna b
a trick question.

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:20.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I say 'yes,'
you have to say 'no,'"

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
